 something deeply hidden has  an impact like that it certainly has a  point of view about quantum mechanics  and the many-worlds interpretation maybe  twenty years from now when a bunch of  people who are now in high school have  read that book and suddenly these people  are young assistant professors in  physics departments maybe there'll be a  different attitude toward quantum  mechanics foundations of quantum  mechanics many worlds even if we  discover you know 10 years from now that  many worlds doesn't work we need do  something else the idea that trying very  hard to understand quantum mechanics is  a respectable one that should be done in  physics departments I think maybe you  know who knows that would be that would  be the best possible outcome of me  writing this book but at the end you  know you've written a book they can't  take that away from you you know they  can't say you've wasted your time  you've you've put in some thought put in  the effort done the best job you can put  some words on paper that now other  people can share and that's a really  good feeling just as it is a really good  feeling sharing these words over the air  these words said out loud so with that  happy holidays thank you so much for  listening to mindscape as you know you  can become a patreon supporter you know  sometimes people say well I have these  questions patreon supporters get asking  me anything episodes once a month except  during the holiday break but patreon  supporters get to ask me questions and I  answer almost every question these days  I think that might I don't know whether  that's gonna last  the AMA episodes are pushing three hours  sometimes now that it's pushing the  limits of my ability to talk if not my  patience but you know that's one way to  express support but again as I said over  and over again who cares if you're a  patreon supporter I  you anyway I love everyone who listens  to the podcast I think it's been a great  adventure we're gonna go to so